Package: termeffects
Title: Term Plots and Simultaneous Confidence Bands for Interaction
    Surfaces
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Brigitte", "Mueller", , "brigitte.mueller@uhn.ca", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Lukas", "Bolsinger", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Computes adjusted predictions with simultaneous confidence
    bands over prediction curves and two-variable interaction surfaces,
    including parameterized (transformed) predictor coordinates, and
    visualizes them as term plots and heatmaps.
